description:
jsonl-repair: JSONL Repair API: turns broken JSON Lines (NDJSON) into one valid record per line - joins, splits, drops fences and chat text, fixes quotes, keys, commas, Python literals; numbers copied as written. No language model: an ambiguous record gets a paid CANNOT REPAIR verdict. $0.003 USDC per call (1 cent is this catalog's minimum).
Method: POST
Input: {"input": "string, required - up to 60000 chars"}
